A macro call to a path with no declaration fails with exit 2, naming the path on stderr; the file is untouched.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Probe plan
---

Body.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md note="{{ macro('core.macros.nope') }}"
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: value "{{ macro('core.macros.nope') }}": no macro declared at config path: core.macros.nope
-- exit --
2
